I have prepared a simple synthesizable 8-bit ALU in SystemVerilog along with a testbench that includes:
 Directed tests for all ALU operations
 Randomized testing (200 random vectors)
 Automatic result checking against a reference model
Files
alu8.sv – RTL source for the 8-bit ALU
tb_alu8.sv – Comprehensive testbench
README.txt – Short coverage and usage summary
