Coverage Explanation
Directed tests: Explicitly verify each supported ALU operation with known inputs.
Random tests: 200 random combinations of operands and opcodes are generated and compared against expected results computed inside the testbench.
Pass criterion: Any mismatch causes the simulation to report an error ($fatal); otherwise, it prints All directed and random tests passed.
 
